    <briefdescription>
<para>Internal tree node of the <computeroutput><ref refid="class_monomial_ideal" kindref="compound">MonomialIdeal</ref></computeroutput> decision tree. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>One node per <computeroutput>(variable, <ref refid="exptable_8h_acbad03742bc161b060402329a67aa889_1acbad03742bc161b060402329a67aa889" kindref="member">exponent</ref>)</computeroutput> step along the path from the root to a stored monomial. <computeroutput><ref refid="class_nmi__node_ae2befbf07282794d61187602fd3092dd_1ae2befbf07282794d61187602fd3092dd" kindref="member">left</ref></computeroutput> / <computeroutput><ref refid="class_nmi__node_afc6cf5fea312d00f38e18facd1588fb5_1afc6cf5fea312d00f38e18facd1588fb5" kindref="member">right</ref></computeroutput> are sibling pointers inside one variable&apos;s exponent list, <computeroutput><ref refid="class_nmi__node_a65a29bd8f0fdd90bec177633799df680_1a65a29bd8f0fdd90bec177633799df680" kindref="member">header</ref></computeroutput> points back to the list head, and <computeroutput><ref refid="class_nmi__node_a89963611987ee2307f76dd827969cf25_1a89963611987ee2307f76dd827969cf25" kindref="member">val</ref></computeroutput> is either <computeroutput><ref refid="class_nmi__node_a9030b175554762d3fe3259f866cba0aa_1a9030b175554762d3fe3259f866cba0aa" kindref="member">down</ref></computeroutput> (next-variable list head, when <computeroutput><ref refid="class_nmi__node_a143c0d9aa55c24f1b62808ff1e95b43d_1a143c0d9aa55c24f1b62808ff1e95b43d" kindref="member">tag</ref> == <ref refid="class_nmi__node_a68c5241fe3d8097927c37e9e02f4481c_1a68c5241fe3d8097927c37e9e02f4481cae54310e93f65c17330635e958bdf4dc8" kindref="member">node</ref></computeroutput>) or <computeroutput><ref refid="class_nmi__node_a88aeb5a363d8252c209754bf1e480449_1a88aeb5a363d8252c209754bf1e480449" kindref="member">bag</ref></computeroutput> (the stored monomial&apos;s baggage, when <computeroutput><ref refid="class_nmi__node_a143c0d9aa55c24f1b62808ff1e95b43d_1a143c0d9aa55c24f1b62808ff1e95b43d" kindref="member">tag</ref> == <ref refid="class_nmi__node_a68c5241fe3d8097927c37e9e02f4481c_1a68c5241fe3d8097927c37e9e02f4481cae72578a1883a4413518adb85a2eca7a7" kindref="member">leaf</ref></computeroutput>). Insertion / lookup walks the tree following variable indices in increasing order. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
